$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tog Neve" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Foggy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> came to the planet of perpetual winter, Tog Neve. Constantly in a blizzard state this inhospitable planet is the home of the most rich mineral deposits ever found. The victor shall either rule this world or it will rule them. Welcome to my newest map.....Tog Neve's, Blizzard of Oz";
